    {
      "subId": "1202503",
      "subQuestName": "用豆子击中荒泷一斗",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "120250301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "120250301": {
            "id": "120250301",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "到这里之前我就想问了，斗虫到底是种什么样的游戏？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250302"
            ]
          },
          "120250302": {
            "id": "120250302",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "你们在野外，应该经常见到鬼兜虫吧。这种虫子的模样看起来很张扬，但其实性格很温和，平时甚至都不怎么动。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250303"
            ]
          },
          "120250303": {
            "id": "120250303",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "不过它们也会有互相争斗的时候，怎么说呢…就算是它们，心中也有不可退让的底线。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250304"
            ]
          },
          "120250304": {
            "id": "120250304",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "所以斗虫，就是用找来的鬼兜虫斗翻对方的游戏。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250307"
            ]
          },
          "120250307": {
            "id": "120250307",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "不要觉得听起来像小孩子的游戏就小看它，背后的学问可深了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250308"
            ]
          },
          "120250308": {
            "id": "120250308",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "本大爷斗过的虫，没有一千，也有八百。经验丰富了之后，光是看花纹和体型，就能知道它的战斗力。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250309"
            ]
          },
          "120250309": {
            "id": "120250309",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "不只是体格，鬼兜虫的情绪也很重要，要是不想打，或者不敢打，也不行。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250310"
            ]
          },
          "120250310": {
            "id": "120250310",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "哈哈哈，不过完全不用担心，你们运气最好的地方就是遇到了我，行家中的行家。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250311"
            ]
          },
          "120250311": {
            "id": "120250311",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "可是，不是我们要斗虫啊…我们只是来看住你的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250312"
            ]
          },
          "120250312": {
            "id": "120250312",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "对哦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250313"
            ]
          },
          "120250313": {
            "id": "120250313",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "但没关系，可能现在你们觉得我在吹嘘，到时候你们就知道我的实力了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250314"
            ]
          },
          "120250314": {
            "id": "120250314",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "那孩子手里的鬼兜虫很强，我们不能轻敌，一定要挑选一只最能打的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250315"
            ]
          },
          "120250315": {
            "id": "120250315",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "他好像根本没听进去…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250316"
            ]
          },
          "120250316": {
            "id": "120250316",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "让我看看…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250317"
            ]
          },
          "120250317": {
            "id": "120250317",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "我们去那边的山坡上吧，那里很可能藏着很厉害的鬼兜虫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1202504",
      "subQuestName": "与荒泷一斗交谈",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "120250201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "120250201": {
            "id": "120250201",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "唔，唔唔…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250202"
            ]
          },
          "120250202": {
            "id": "120250202",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "你、你没事吧！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250203"
            ]
          },
          "120250203": {
            "id": "120250203",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "怎么办，好像比预想中严重得多！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250204"
            ]
          },
          "120250204": {
            "id": "120250204",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "没事，不用担心…只是，过敏而已…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250205"
            ]
          },
          "120250205": {
            "id": "120250205",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "这种程度，只需要本大爷咬咬牙，很轻松就…唔…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250206"
            ]
          },
          "120250206": {
            "id": "120250206",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "算了，装不下去了！我快窒息了！有什么事待会儿再说，先让本大爷歇会儿！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250207"
            ]
          },
          "120250207": {
            "id": "120250207",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "哈啊——终于缓过来了，不过身子还有点用不上力气…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250208"
            ]
          },
          "120250208": {
            "id": "120250208",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "你们太卑鄙了，居然偷袭本大爷！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250210",
              "120250212"
            ]
          },
          "120250210": {
            "id": "120250210",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "原来是来抓我的家伙，我都跑了这么远，怎么还是被你们找到了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250213"
            ]
          },
          "120250213": {
            "id": "120250213",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "算了，总之我是不会跟你们回去的，识相的话就快走吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250214"
            ]
          },
          "120250214": {
            "id": "120250214",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "本大爷可是相当厉害的，我不想对你们这样的普通人动手。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250215"
            ]
          },
          "120250215": {
            "id": "120250215",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "口气这么大，明明是我们占优势啊…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250216"
            ]
          },
          "120250216": {
            "id": "120250216",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "抢劫和掳掠事件，都是你做的吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250217"
            ]
          },
          "120250217": {
            "id": "120250217",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "是啊，没错，都是本大爷一个人干的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250218"
            ]
          },
          "120250218": {
            "id": "120250218",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "我们「荒泷派」没吃没喝，本大爷是当老大的，抢点吃的抢点酒不是很正常吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250219"
            ]
          },
          "120250219": {
            "id": "120250219",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "那也不至于要抓人吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250220"
            ]
          },
          "120250220": {
            "id": "120250220",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "那…抓人来钱不是更快嘛！摩拉这东西，自然是越多越好！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250221"
            ]
          },
          "120250221": {
            "id": "120250221",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "多出来的钱，嗯…分给弟兄们拿出去花了！"
          },
          "120250212": {
            "id": "120250212",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "唔…得了得了，你们是来抓我的吧？我都跑了这么远，怎么还是被你们找到了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1202505",
      "subQuestName": "前往捉鬼兜虫的地点",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "120250501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "120250501": {
            "id": "120250501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大辅",
            "text": "你们终于回来了，我们现在可以开始了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250502"
            ]
          },
          "120250502": {
            "id": "120250502",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "那当然，这次我带回来的鬼兜虫，可是特别厉害的家伙。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250503"
            ]
          },
          "120250503": {
            "id": "120250503",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大辅",
            "text": "我是不会害怕的，去吧，「白纹凶鬼」！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250504"
            ]
          },
          "120250504": {
            "id": "120250504",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "这次一定是我赢，上吧，「灵巧忍者」！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250505"
            ]
          },
          "120250505": {
            "id": "120250505",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "你什么时候起的名字啊！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250506"
            ]
          },
          "120250506": {
            "id": "120250506",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "加油，快上啊！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250507"
            ]
          },
          "120250507": {
            "id": "120250507",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大辅",
            "text": "好样的，再加把劲！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250508"
            ]
          },
          "120250508": {
            "id": "120250508",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "啊——我的「灵巧忍者」！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250509"
            ]
          },
          "120250509": {
            "id": "120250509",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大辅",
            "text": "好耶，又是我赢了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250510"
            ]
          },
          "120250510": {
            "id": "120250510",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "可恶啊，这下就七连败了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250513"
            ]
          },
          "120250513": {
            "id": "120250513",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大辅",
            "text": "嘿嘿，「白纹凶鬼」是无敌的，就连一斗哥哥也赢不了它。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250514"
            ]
          },
          "120250514": {
            "id": "120250514",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "这笔账，我会记住的，下次一定要打赢你。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250515"
            ]
          },
          "120250515": {
            "id": "120250515",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "喂，小家伙，把你的「深红旋风」拿出来，帮我出这口恶气。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250516"
            ]
          },
          "120250516": {
            "id": "120250516",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "好，上吧，「深红旋风」！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250517"
            ]
          },
          "120250517": {
            "id": "120250517",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你居然已经接受这个名字了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250518"
            ]
          },
          "120250518": {
            "id": "120250518",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大辅",
            "text": "呜哇，这只鬼兜虫，好厉害！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250519"
            ]
          },
          "120250519": {
            "id": "120250519",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大辅",
            "text": "不能输啊，「白纹凶鬼」！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250520"
            ]
          },
          "120250520": {
            "id": "120250520",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "哼哼，快点上，使用「超级派蒙旋风」！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250521"
            ]
          },
          "120250521": {
            "id": "120250521",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "哪里有这种招式啊！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250522"
            ]
          },
          "120250522": {
            "id": "120250522",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大辅",
            "text": "居然…输了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250523"
            ]
          },
          "120250523": {
            "id": "120250523",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嘿嘿，赢了！「深红旋风」挺厉害的嘛。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250524"
            ]
          },
          "120250524": {
            "id": "120250524",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "我都没想到这只虫子这么能打，居然轻松就战胜了「白纹凶鬼」…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250525"
            ]
          },
          "120250525": {
            "id": "120250525",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "不愧是我看中的斗虫高手，嗯嗯，真令人高兴啊，好伙计！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250526"
            ]
          },
          "120250526": {
            "id": "120250526",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嘿嘿，我果然很有天赋！当然「深红旋风」功劳也很大！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250527"
            ]
          },
          "120250527": {
            "id": "120250527",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "要不然，把它送给大辅吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250528"
            ]
          },
          "120250528": {
            "id": "120250528",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "对哦，毕竟斗完虫就要…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250529"
            ]
          },
          "120250529": {
            "id": "120250529",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大辅",
            "text": "嗯…？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250530"
            ]
          },
          "120250530": {
            "id": "120250530",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "我把这个送给你吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250531"
            ]
          },
          "120250531": {
            "id": "120250531",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大辅",
            "text": "欸，这个，为什么？真的可以吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250532"
            ]
          },
          "120250532": {
            "id": "120250532",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "收下吧，你有了这么强的虫子，等到时候我们回去，你就可以和你的朋友炫耀了啊。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250533"
            ]
          },
          "120250533": {
            "id": "120250533",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大辅",
            "text": "我们…还能回去吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250534"
            ]
          },
          "120250534": {
            "id": "120250534",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "那当然了，相信我，本大爷可从来不食言。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250535"
            ]
          },
          "120250535": {
            "id": "120250535",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "那就先这样，我和我的这两个朋友还有事要商量，你先和鬼婆婆玩一会儿吧，要听话哦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250536"
            ]
          },
          "120250536": {
            "id": "120250536",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "看来已经没问题了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250537"
            ]
          },
          "120250537": {
            "id": "120250537",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大辅",
            "text": "其实你们是天领奉行派来的人对吧？是来抓一斗哥哥的对吧！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250538"
            ]
          },
          "120250538": {
            "id": "120250538",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250539"
            ]
          },
          "120250539": {
            "id": "120250539",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "荒泷一斗",
            "text": "#我不是说了嘛，{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_HE|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SHE]}们都是哥哥的朋友…都是「荒泷派」的弟兄们，关系好得很呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250540"
            ]
          },
          "120250540": {
            "id": "120250540",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大辅",
            "text": "#骗人，「荒泷派」一共才几个人，我每个人都认得，但从来没见过{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_HE|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SHE]}们！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250541"
            ]
          },
          "120250541": {
            "id": "120250541",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大辅",
            "text": "一斗哥哥没有干坏事，你们不要抓走他！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120250542"
            ]
          },
          "120250542": {
            "id": "120250542",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大辅",
            "text": "他不仅没有做坏事，还救了我的命！他不是坏人！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
